<div id="Welcome" class="tabcontent">
  <h1>Welcome to the US Tax Court Library Catalog</h1>
<br>
<p class="ex1">You do not need to log into the system to search the catalog.</p>

<br>

<p class="ex1"><b>To log in:</b> Click "Log in" at the upper-right hand corner of this screen.</p>

<p class="ex1">Logging in also enables you to put holds on books and create your own lists.</p>

<p class="ex1">For best results: take advantage of the pull-down menu to search by title, author, etc., or click on "Advanced Search" for more options.</p>

<p class="ex1">Library staff members are available to answer your questions via phone, e-mail or in person.</p>

<p class="ex1">One-on-one appointments with a librarian are always available.</p>

<p class="ex1">If you need help, please contact the Library at ext. 4585 or <a href="mailto:Library@ustaxcourt.gov">Library@ustaxcourt.gov</a>.</p>

<div id="HowToFind">
<p></p><center><b id="HowToFindTitle">How do I find...</b></center><p></p>

<ul style="list-style-type:disc;">
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">Cumulative Bulletin</b> – available in full text on <a href="https://www.westlaw.com/Browse/Home/AdministrativeDecisionsGuidance/FederalAdministrativeDecisionsGuidance/DepartmentoftheTreasuryUSTREAS/InternalRevenueServiceIRS/IRSCumulativeBulletin?transitionType=Default&amp;contextData=(sc.Default)&amp;VR=3.0&amp;RS=cblt1.0"><u>Westlaw</u></a> and <a href="https://advance.lexis.com/api/permalink/7644d7bd-c4c5-4550-b52c-2c6dc0ce7757/?context=1000516"><u>Lexis</u></a> without pincites and <a href="https://heinonline.org/HOL/Index?index=usfed/ircb&amp;collection=tera"><u>HeinOnline</u></a> if you need pincites (you must be on the Court’s network to access Hein). </li>
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">Explanatory Notes to Tax Court Rules:</b> <a href="https://heinonline.org/HOL/Index?index=usfed/tcrustc&amp;collection=usfed"><u>HeinOnline</u></a> </li>
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">Older Internal Revenue code versions: </b>
<br>Westlaw: code 1990-present 
<br>Lexis: code 1992-present 
<br>HeinOnline has the complete official US Code (1925-1926 to 2018 – the first Internal Revenue code was compiled in 1939)</li> 
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">Older Treasury Regulations: </b>
<br>Westlaw: 1984-present 
<br>Lexis: 1981-present 
<br>HeinOnline: The entire Code of Federal Regulations 1938-present 
<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hein also contains Treasury Regulations that predate the CFR</li>
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">IRMs</b> – <a href="https://advance.lexis.com/api/permalink/b9e44963-b08a-4bac-a4c5-b36ac4a8bab8/?context=1001091"><u>Lexis</u></a> is easier (2012-present) or <a href="https://www.westlaw.com/Browse/Home/SecondarySources/TaxSecondarySources/ResearchInstituteofAmericaRIA/FederalTaxationRIA/InternalRevenueManualIRMCurrentEdition/InternalRevenueManualIRMAll?transitionType=Default&amp;contextData=(sc.Default)&amp;VR=3.0&amp;RS=cblt1.0"><u>Westlaw</u></a> (1997-present)</li>
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">Tax Treaties (including background material):</b> <a href="https://www.westlaw.com/Browse/Home/SecondarySources/TaxSecondarySources/ResearchInstituteofAmericaRIA/InternationalTaxationRIA/TaxTreatiesRIA?transitionType=Default&amp;contextData=(sc.Default)&amp;VR=3.0&amp;RS=cblt1.0"><u>Westlaw</u>,</a> <a href="https://advance.lexis.com/api/permalink/9a266ffb-c9e7-4f7e-b2a5-177c28e1c370/?context=1000516"><u>Lexis</u>,</a> <a href="https://www.bloomberglaw.com/product/tax/page/page_international"><u>Bloomberg Law</u></a> (use the treaty finder in upper right-hand column), <a href="https://www.irs.gov/businesses/international-businesses/united-states-income-tax-treaties-a-to-z"><u>IRS.gov</u></a></li>
<br>
<li><b id="HowToFindHeader">CCH pagination for TC Memo decisions</b> – Bloomberg Law/Bloomberg Law Tax 
</li><li>Click on the pagination link in the upper right-hand corner of the opinion and either slide the button or click the radial button (depending on whether you’re using BLaw or BLaw Tax) </li>
<br>
<li>Bloomberg Law pagination:
<br><a href="https://ustc-koha-homepage.s3.amazonaws.com/koha+images/landing+page+images/bothke+v.+commissioner%2C+39+t.c.m.+(cch)+826%2C+t.c.+.jpg"><img src="https://ustc-koha-homepage.s3.amazonaws.com/koha+images/landing+page+images/bothke+v.+commissioner%2C+39+t.c.m.+(cch)+826%2C+t.c.+.jpg" width="100%" height="100%"></a></li>
<br>
<li>Bloomberg Law Tax pagination:
<br><a href="https://ustc-koha-homepage.s3.amazonaws.com/koha+images/landing+page+images/little+v.+commissioner%2C+69+t.c.m.+(cch)+1575%2C+t.c.jpg"><img src="https://ustc-koha-homepage.s3.amazonaws.com/koha+images/landing+page+images/little+v.+commissioner%2C+69+t.c.m.+(cch)+1575%2C+t.c.jpg" width="100%" height="100%&quot;"></a></li>

</ul>
